sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant Cl as Client
    participant Rec as Recursive resolver
    participant Any as Anycast edge
    participant Auth as Authoritative server
    participant CP as Control plane
    participant Hc as Health checker
    Cl->>Rec: resolve service.tenant.example
    alt cached and within TTL
        Rec-->>Cl: cached answer
    else
        Rec->>Any: query — anycast routes to the nearest site
        Any->>Auth: look up the tenant zone
        Auth->>Auth: apply the tenant's routing policy
        Auth-->>Rec: answer with a short TTL
        Rec-->>Cl: address
    end
    loop continuously
        Hc->>Auth: mark unhealthy endpoints down
        CP->>Auth: push zone updates to every site
    end
